<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 19.75 to 6041.68.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.39 to 375.07.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.15.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1331 to 1040.</p>
<p>Volume was 391,045,410, compared with 463,777,340 Friday.</p>
